 * - 🟢 Green: Strong Action Verb + Quantifiable Metrics/Scale (ATS Ready)
 * - 🟡 Amber: Good (Missing Metrics or Strong Action Verb)
 * - 🔴 Red: Needs Improvement (Too Short, Passive "Responsible for", or Over Limit)
